        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "pg_stat_subscription.last_msg_receipt_time of the apply worker; 0 while there is no worker. A healthy idle subscription peaks near 30 s."
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "title": "Subscription: apply errors, sync errors, conflicts",
